Write a function sum4_low that takes four unsigned 32-bit numbers a, b, c, d and returns the lowest 16 bits of their sum (the sum modulo 65536), as an unsigned 32-bit number. Put a, b, c, d in that order into a sequence of four unsigned 32-bit numbers and pass it to a helper function sum4(v) that returns the sum of the four values of v as an unsigned 64-bit number; write and use that helper.
